WEBVTT

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:34.110
It's dangerous!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.320
Toki, get back!

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.530
You idiot!

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:37.570
What are you doing?!

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.490
You'll be engulfed!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.130
I hate you. I hate you.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.090
I'll curse you. I'll curse you.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:57.970
Imayou just adored her master.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.720
Revenge for Master.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:06.770
Her deep and pure love turned into a strong hatred of human beings.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.310
And the ones who drove her there were...

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.610
we humans.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:15.190
She couldn't do anything on her own.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.780
She suffered.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.280
And all she could do was explode.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.620
All she could do was blame humans.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.120
If this is what my wish caused,

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.250
then this should be my responsibility.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.380
If I want to save humans,
then demons are sacrificed.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:40.390
Is that... Is such a hopeless
outcome what I wanted?

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.430
No!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.350
What I wanted was...

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.320
Toki!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:04.830
Are you all right?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.910
He's breathing.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.910
He just fainted from the effects
of the evil aura.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.500
I see.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.000
Oh. Is this fox Imayou?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.880
Imayou.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.680
What a feat of strength.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.810
It hasn't resolved any of the issues,

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.520
but it seems his feelings were understood.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.230
The mountain labored
and brought forth a fox.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.190
Was saving one mere fox

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:42.280
what you wanted to do
by involving so many people?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.580
I like that personality of yours, Utsubushi.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.040
Yakou.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.120
It seems you've failed to get
your precious research material.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.960
Is that your conclusion?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.800
Yeah, it is.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.720
Go back to your bed with your regrets.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.260
You bastard.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.100
Tsuyukusa!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:06.930
Hey!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.390
Utsubushi, don't worry.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.600
This was just a curtain raiser.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:16.560
If these idiots get back on the stage again,
eventually the real performance will start.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.650
The players are assembled.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.150
Will it be a comedy or a tragedy?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:26.370
Either way, the key player
is the Blank Page.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.080
I see. So last night something
like that did happen.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.840
If I consider the activities of the head clerk, something like that could have occurred.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.050
I saw it that time.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.300
There are others who have fallen asleep too.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.800
Are they going to die?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:46.800
That's scary.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:52.640
The priest purified the head clerk and the others, so don't worry.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.600
I caused everyone a lot of
trouble over this incident.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.320
If anyone wants to quit,
please feel free to do so.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.740
I'll help however I can with my savings.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.320
No, owner. You don't have to do that.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:08.570
It's true that our store sold illegal drugs.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.580
We can't avoid being charged.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.160
That wasn't just the head clerk's fault.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.330
It was also my fault for not stopping him.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.920
The head clerk must have ruined many lives.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:27.390
But it's also true that he supported
this store and me.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:32.390
Perhaps I was the one who made him do that.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.020
No.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:33.720
Huh?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.810
The head clerk yielded to the temptation of the numbers game.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:43.690
As the numbers increase, people forget
what the numbers represent and lose their purpose.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:50.370
The head clerk forgot that beyond the numbers,
there are humans with flesh and blood.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.910
The numbers game, huh?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:58.460
Yes. But that's a bad habit we all have.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.840
Excuse me.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.340
Oh, sorry.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.010
Huh?

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:04.760
Oh?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.840
Aren't you the apprentice boy from Yorozu-ya? What's your business here?!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.300
That's what I want to know...

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.720
officer.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.940
My fellow officer quit, so I came here on a matter related to that.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.480
I heard that your colleague was friendly with the head clerk of this store.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:29.240
So I need to ask the storekeeper about the relationship between those two.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.200
Hey. Get out, you outsiders!

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.080
Yes, yes, I understand. We'll go.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:37.960
Stingy.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.620
Kurotobi!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.090
The express messenger I sent to Sasaki-sama seems to have arrived in time.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:44.840
What?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.340
We made quite a lot of noise last night.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:53.260
I asked Sasaki-sama to prevent any officer
connected with the head clerk from coming here.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:57.270
Then the colleague who "quit"
must've been fired by Sasaki-san.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.770
Yamauchi-san is a straightforward
and serious person.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.070
He'll believe that the murder
at Naitou-Shinjuku

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.900
was a territorial fight between gangsters and will deal with it accordingly.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.860
So this incident is resolved.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.740
Well, for me, Rikugou-san,

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:20.000
the question of your friendship
with Amaza is not yet resolved.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.870
I'm not their friend!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.500
Oh, so you won't mind

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:30.680
if I call Yamauchi-san over and have him arrest the man with the tattoos on his left arm?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.880
Would...

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.350
you mind not doing that?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.390
Um, he saved me when I was in danger.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.480
Rikugou-san, I have to say this.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:47.480
If you're going to take their side,
we'll kill you first.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.200
You have a very rare power,

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.030
but that's all you have.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.700
You can't even save your own life.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:02.790
You shouldn't dream that people and demons
can understand each other's hearts.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:08.000
Otherwise, you'll end up
in worse shape than this.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.170
You'll end up dead.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.800
I believe that you should be on our side.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:17.300
I personally don't like harming other people.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.470
I don't want you to leave me
with a bad taste in my mouth.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.000
What's this?

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.560
One to the south.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.440
One to the north.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.480
One to the east.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.400
One to the west.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.410
And in the center is the gods' house.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.830
Wh-What?

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.540
Damn it.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.640
This is such magnificent power.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.020
Hey, Rikugou.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.520
It's a bit strange to see you in the sunshine.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:51.520
Aren't you mistaking us
for ghosts or vampires?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:55.440
I want to move quickly,

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.360
but there's an idiot
over there with Tsuyukusa.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:01.870
Heihachi-san?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.750
Are you ready?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:08.420
Huh?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.380
What?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.340
What the hell is this?!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.550
Stop yelling in my ear!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.720
You're choking him. You're choking him!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.890
Wh-What is that?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.640
It's Tsuyukusa.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.850
He exhausted his power
to maintain a human shape.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:32.900
If we leave him somewhere, he'll recover eventually
and return to his previous form.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:36.740
What? That means we must let him rest.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.860
We mustn't move him!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.490
Why do I have to give priority to his condition?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.580
Aren't you friends?!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.870
Heh. I don't think I have any friends.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.580
Then what about him?

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.910
He's my transportation.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.250
Imayou.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:57.630
She seems to understand which human saved her.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:02.470
Isn't this the first time we've talked so closely, Hakutaku?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.140
Um, yes.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.060
My name is Utsubushi.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.270
Nice to meet you.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:09.390
Y-Yeah.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.900
Oh, you are definitely just like a child.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.270
It's amazing that you have such great power in such a small body.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:16.610
Stop it!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.700
U-Um, my name is Rikugou.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:25.120
Oh, Hakutaku is the name of a sacred beast
that has the wisdom of men.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.490
Isn't that like the Blank Page?

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.580
So demons use that as a nickname for you.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.250
Wisdom?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.710
No, I'm not that clever.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.460
Yes, you don't seem to live up to your name.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.970
Well, you don't seem like a bad-hearted person.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:48.640
I thought Bon was overrating you,
but it seems I made a mistake.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.850
Actually, it's all up to the user, Utsubushi.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:56.520
He may be a coward who can't use his power,

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.360
but the power itself is useful for me.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:04.240
If he had real intelligence,
then it would be easier to control.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.570
I see.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.080
Excuse me.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.330
Sorry for interrupting you.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.250
Take it easy.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.960
He can't see.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.680
I heard that Shamon-dono's friends are here,
so I came here to thank them.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:28.890
Oh, you must be quite tall.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:34.060
W-Well, I've h-hit my head
on the lintel several times.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:40.730
I heard that you did your
best during this incident.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.360
No need to thank us.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.110
Huh?

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.410
Oh, sorry.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.200
Hey, Imayou.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.660
Is it a puppy?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.420
Oh, maybe it wants...

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.580
this.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.220
Oh, hey!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.260
I don't mind. I'll give it to you.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:09.220
Carving is what I do as a hobby.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:13.270
I carved a piece of wood from that camphor tree,
so it should smell good.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.650
There was a small inari
in front of that camphor tree.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:19.310
I suddenly remembered, so I made that.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.780
To be honest,

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:26.320
some things that happened during this incident have made me believe in the supernatural.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.070
When I was covered with fire,

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:34.870
a voice as cool as cold water
echoed in my head.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.120
This way!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.800
I felt the wind at my back,

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.550
even though I was sure I'd closed the door.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.510
My life was saved that way.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:54.600
Also, the only thing that burned
in the warehouse was that trunk.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.560
Go ahead and laugh.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:04.360
I can't help thinking that
the trunk burned in my place.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.360
I wouldn't laugh.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.660
Rather, I want to believe
that's what really happened.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:16.040
Men and demons always misunderstand each other and experience difficulties.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.870
Imayou.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.760
But...

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.350
Thank you.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.770
Even if there is only one...

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.940
weak and frail relationship,

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.150
if it can be of help to someone...

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.280
and even if people laugh at me for chasing a pipe dream...

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.990
I want...

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.830
to pursue that dream.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.560
You're exactly as I dreamed.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.520
Nice to meet you,

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.860
Teiten.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:30.530
How pitiful your brain is.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:37.410
So, Toki, how did you become
friends with these people?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.790
Um...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:43.920
What if I said they're spirits?
But they're not bad ones.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.460
Would you get angry?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.130
What? Did Kuchiha tell you something?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:53.090
No. It's Sasaki-san and Kurotobi-san.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.260
They say that all demons are enemies.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.270
Yeah, they would say something like that.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:04.350
But as for me, I don't think
all demons are enemies.

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.520
Is that so?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:13.530
Yeah. But it's also true that men and demons
are getting in each other's way.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.030
Neither is willing to compromise all that much,

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.160
so they think that complete dominance, or complete exclusion,

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.450
are the only ways to settle the issue.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:25.580
But if we compromise like you
and these guys have,

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.630
I'm sure we can help each other.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.180
I think so too.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.300
What a boring story.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:40.310
Priest, you seem to have a flexible point of view, considering your job.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:44.940
But it's not just men and demons that are fighting for power.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:50.440
There are humans, there are demons, and then there's heaven.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.240
Huh?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:53.400
Isn't heaven already the ruler of everything?

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.030
Are you going to...

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.660
What?

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.080
Explain it properly!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:05.080
Why don't you learn from that priest
and try thinking for yourself first?

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.920
Don't leave the decisions to others.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.630
There's heaven above us.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.050
They're listening to us,
not missing a word we say.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.340
The only one they don't know is you.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.810
Are you planning something
that mustn't be overheard?

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.680
Don't you understand yet?

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.230
What I call heaven is

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:30.730
an existence that has will and looks down on this world from a throne high above.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:36.450
When we were in the interval space,
I asked you to choose the Princess or me.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:40.910
That's because I didn't want
Teiten to overhear us.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.040
Did you understand what I was saying?

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.290
Humans hate demons and are ignorant of heaven's power.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:52.250
Demons hate humans and blame heaven for how they're treated.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:56.510
Heaven watches over humans
and controls the demons.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:59.640
These three relationships are
all stable on their own,

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:02.260
and heaven won't forgive anyone who breaks that stability.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.710
Priestess, why is this?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.790
Why do you disobey heaven?

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:35.380
Why do you forget your obligations?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.090
Why do you not guard the net?

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.090
Why do you draw a bow against heaven?

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:46.890
Why?

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.600
Because we don't need you.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.650
Isn't Teiten our enemy?

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.400
Are you going to take control from heaven?

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.820
What on earth...

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.530
Are you insane?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.740
What's wrong?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.120
Isn't that cool?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.660
A power struggle with heaven,
now that's exciting.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:10.790
Of course. If that wasn't the case,
demons wouldn't follow Bon.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.130
Ridiculous!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.430
Priestess.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.930
Plead for mercy!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:23.930
Go back!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.020
Like a god and Buddha combined...

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.930
What a mess.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.730
I will forgive you if you repent now.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:32.940
What will you do?

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.230
I have already made a vow with someone.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.450
Rather than wait quietly
for desolation to come,

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.950
I will move forward.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.200
Wh-What?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.460
Feel the power you gave me...

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.710
with your own body!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.210
What you're doing is useless.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.880
That may be,

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:04.180
but I'd rather choose a future I don't know,
than the future I <i>do</i> know!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.970
You are insolent!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.400
I am disappointed.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.410
Since we took care of you...

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.160
This voice...

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.370
Teiten.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.130
What?

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.720
Is this...

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:02.150
Run...

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:02.900
far away.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.150
Is that Ginshu?

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.530
Hurry!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.790
Toki...

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.710
Why do men and demons fight?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.800
What is the difference
between men and demons?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.510
What is heaven?

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.680
The Princess serves both
heaven's net and Teiten.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.640
In other words, her goal is
to destroy this world.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.260
I want to preserve this world

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.640
and to make you the new Teiten.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:39.110
What makes people?

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.780
What makes demons?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.990
What makes you?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.160
Now, boy...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.540
What is discipline?

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.750
What is death?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.960
What is life?
